    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wafwili mwanta Uziya namweni Mwanta nashakami hetanda mawanta, hewulu hanyamuka, mutembeli mwenzeli ihina dindi to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hewulu dindi hanemani aserafwi, wejima wawu akweti mpuula jawu, iwu jitanu nayimu, iwu jitanu nayimu; jiyedi nabuti nachu kumesu, jiyedinabuti nachu kunyendu, jiyedi hakutúuka nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwu hakubidika kudi mukwawu nindi, Yehova wamazaza Wajila, Wajila, Wajila. Iseki deji madina wanini kwakulema kwindi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyipamba yakuchisu hikukukankanezu dayenowu wabidikili, niitala hidikwinzala wishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukwila nami, Yayo, ami! Jinankumi; ami muntu wanyivumbu yamajilu, nashakamahamu nawantu anyivumbu yamajilu, mesu ami anamoni Mwanta, Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaserafwi wumu hakutúuka, hakwinza kudami, muchikasa chindi nasendi ikala dakesi dananoniyi nanzamba hakameŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakunkunkadu kukanwa kami, nindi, Tala, idi dinakukunki dehi kunyivumbu yeyi; kuluwa kweyi kunafumi dehi, ninshidi yeyi anayitookeshi dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya izu daMwanta, nindi, Nukutemeshanyi? Wukutuyilahinyi? Ami nami, Yamonu, ntemeshami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Yaku wakaleji antuawa neyi, Kutiya mukutiya, bayi mushinshika mwokuku, kumona mukumona, bayi mwiiuka mwokuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Supishaku nyichima yawantu awa, wuyijiki mumatu awu, wuyijimi mumesu awu; akenda kamona namesuawu, akenda katiya namatu awu, akenda kashinshika nanyichima yawu, akenda kabalumuka cheŋa, hiyakayuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nami, Nikumwakanyi Mwanta? Nindi, Chiŋa nyikala yineli dehi kwamahembi hohu yakadininiwu wukushakamamu, nimatala nawa chochu nimuntu wukwikalamunehi, niituŋa dinabalumuki kwachihembi hohu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichakela Yehova natwali dehi antu kwakulehi, nichimwakela mwituŋa munashali dehi kwazo-o mwakadi nimuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwakashala chibalu chamwikumi, nichena nawa akachidya; neyi muterebinti, hela mukula, wakwila anawutemi dehi wunashali dehi kwachishinji; choche nochu nawa anyana ajiladichi chishinji chawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
